    "ssky_text_block_FqJQ66": {
      "type": "ssky-text-block",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_rFzF8y": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Inspiring Nonfiction Books for Teens</p>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "center",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "center": false
          }
        },
        "text_yxXaUf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>If we’re all honest, many nonfiction books can feel dry, boring, or overly complex, especially when it comes to books for teens. But our books are written with experience and values, providing meaningful content with simple language.</p><p>Our books are designed to encourage independent thinking and evoke family discussions. Your teen may be a budding economist, a history enthusiast, or simply curious about how the world works, and we’ve made sure that our books deliver.</p><p>Every title is carefully researched and full of relatable examples. Teens will discover how money works, why personal freedom matters, learn about <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-guide-to-courageous-heroes\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">courageous heroes</span></a>, and how past events in <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/american-history-for-kids\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">American history</span></a> shape the present. Our writing style is friendly yet professional, prioritizing short sentences, easy explanations, and just the right amount of technical detail.</p>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_rFzF8y",
        "text_yxXaUf"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.ssky_text_block.name",
      "settings": {
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "max_width": 100,
        "color_scheme": "",
        "twi_max_width": 120,
        "twi_margin": 20,
