    "ssky_text_column_JNT34d": {
      "type": "ssky-text-column",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Q9J8Nb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "text": "<p>Our books for teens to read go far beyond ordinary books. Each book presents real-world concepts, such as entrepreneurship, personal freedom, and responsible citizenship, through engaging storytelling. Teens don’t just learn — they understand and apply these ideas to their own lives. Here are some benefits:</p>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        },
        "text_column_nn9TkR": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Critical Thinking Skills</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>We encourage your teen to question assumptions with books like<a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-guide-to-beware-your-bias\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Beware Your Bias</span></a> and think independently. Through real-life examples and thought-provoking scenarios, your child can learn to analyze issues rather than simply accept them.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_ipghiL": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Real-World Application</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>Concepts like economics, free markets, and individual rights are explained in ways that teens can connect to daily life, like starting a business, budgeting, or understanding current events.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_mQfymj": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-4",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Engaging, Age-Appropriate Language</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>Written in a clear, conversational style, these books are easy to read without watering down important ideas. Our books keep teens engaged while teaching them about complex concepts.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_xYH3r4": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-4",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Strong Moral Foundations</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>The stories promote honesty, responsibility, and respect for others. These values help teens build character and confidence in their decision-making.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_wytFnV": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Durable, High-Quality Editions</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>Our books are designed to be read again and again, and each book is well-bound with vibrant covers and clean layouts. They’re great for home libraries, classrooms, or as gifts.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_wJrdMc": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "",
            "heading": "<p><strong>Great for Independent or Family Reading</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>Teens can enjoy these books on their own or discuss them with their parents, siblings, or homeschool groups. Our books spark deeper conversations and can lead teens to develop their own opinions about freedom, ethics, and personal growth.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        }
      },
