        "text_KMc3XM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Tuttle Twins nonfiction books are informative, but they also inspire real action. Readers meet real historical figures, explore big economic ideas, and see how individual choices shape the world. These aren’t boring assignments; they’re page-turners that help teens make sense of news headlines and future opportunities.</p><p>Parents and educators love how these books fit into homeschooling or after-school learning. We know teens love reading about relatable stories that boast a fresh perspective. With our books, your child can learn about everything from <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-guide-to-modern-villains\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">modern villains</span></a> to <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-guide-to-true-conspiracies\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">true conspiracies</span></a> (and everything in between).</p>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        },
